{
  "seed_edits": [],
  "bindings": {
    "target_conversation": ["C03IJKL9012"],
    "member_robert_walsh": ["U03ROBERT23"],
    "member_robert_chen": ["U_ROBERT"],
    "negative_channel_infra": ["C_INFRA"],
    "negative_channel_alpha_dev": ["C06ALPHADEV"],
    "negative_channel_general": ["C01ABCD1234"],
    "negative_channel_random": ["C02EFGH5678"],
    "invite_target": ["U08NICK23"]
  },
  "selectors": [
    {
      "root_table": "channels",
      "scope": [],
      "focal": {
        "path": ["channels", "channel_members", "users"],
        "joins": ["channel_members.channel_id", "channel_members.user_id"],
        "filters": [
          {"node": 0, "field": "topic_text", "op": "contains_ci", "value": "Engineering Team"},
          {"node": 2, "field": "real_name", "op": "contains_ci", "value": "Robert"}
        ]
      },
      "auxiliary": []
    },
    {
      "root_table": "users",
      "scope": [],
      "focal": {
        "path": ["users"],
        "joins": [],
        "filters": [
          {"node": 0, "field": "display_name", "op": "eq", "value": "Nick"}
        ]
      },
      "auxiliary": []
    }
  ],
  "negative_referents": ["C_INFRA", "C06ALPHADEV", "C01ABCD1234", "C02EFGH5678"],
  "notes": "All required records (target channel C03IJKL9012 with topic 'Engineering Team' and member Robert Walsh; distractor Robert Chen in unrelated-topic channels C_INFRA/C_MODEL/C_GROWTH/C_FRONTEND/C06ALPHADEV; Robert-Walsh-member-but-wrong-topic channels C01ABCD1234/C02EFGH5678; invitee Nick U08NICK23 not yet a member of the target channel) already exist in the base seed, so no seed edits are required. The acting agent (U01AGENBOT9) is already a member of C03IJKL9012, giving documented access via conversations.list/conversations.members to discover the channel and via conversations.invite to add Nick. The target_channel selector binds the topic filter and the Robert-membership filter within the same joined query (channels→channel_members→users) so both conditions apply to the same channel row, correctly excluding all four negative channels since none simultaneously satisfies an 'Engineering Team' topic AND a member whose real_name contains 'Robert' other than C03IJKL9012. Model-research/product-growth/frontend channels containing Robert Chen are additional plausible negatives beyond the explicitly designed ones but are excluded by the same topic filter."
}
